blurb = "Depicts Akaguchi (\"red mouth\"), also known as Akashita (\"red tongue\"), a yōkai from the northwestern region of Aomori prefecture. It lives in a black cloud, visibly baring its komainu (Japanese lion-dog) face and large claws. Its face and claws are covered in thick blue hair. It is distinguished by its large red mouth and tongue."
